126 commits since b300787 (87 without merges):

- shared native C families bound across boot and all 27 overlays, a
  separate small-data unit per overlay, entity callbacks and resident
  wrappers matched;
- exact SDK boot objects (CPR8, sysbit, IPU DMA restart) and libgcc's
  fp-bit single-precision unpacker from vendored source;
- the complete GNU EE compiler rebuild recipe, measured small-data
  behaviour, bounded local-GP proofs;
- campaign tooling: immutable trial review, guarded batch…
